          "canonical_hash": "sha256:2cdb5fc3e6343d24adb4e1f93c6c440b896607a99733a083ab4ac19c0cce0d0a",
          "description": "Create a keyless pay-to-unlock page with ZERO setup, no account, no API key: sell a file link, license key, or secret text (up to 100,000 chars) for a fixed price. The buyer pays the set USD price straight to your wallet and the payload is revealed on their paid confirmation, never before. Non-custodial. (To deliver an actual uploaded file up to 10MB, use the multipart HTTP API at /api/v1/unlocks.) IMPORTANT: confirm with your principal that the content is not adult, illegal, or non-consensual, then pass aup_accepted=true, otherwise the call fails.",
